Derivations
===========

This program is AGPL-3.0-or-later, as FluffyChat is. Part of its user
interface reproduces the look and behaviour of Telegram for Android
(Copyright (C) 2017-2026 Telegram FZ-LLC, GNU GPL v. 2 or later). The
values taken from it are measurements and layout rules, and in the files
listed below its code structure or its theme file format as well. Every
listed file cites the Telegram source file and line in a comment, carries
a notice that this fork changed it in 2026, and is written in
Flutter/Dart. No Telegram binary, asset, name or resource ships with
this program.

